      ">",
      "> **Yes/no question —** a question answered with yes or no.",
      ">",
      "> **Wh-question —** a question beginning with who, what, when, where, why or how.",
      ">",
      "> **Reported command —** an order reported with \\*told\\* and an infinitive.",
